// bignum.twofish: Twofish (Schneier et al., 1998) with 16-, 24- and
// 32-byte keys, as Go's x/crypto/twofish has it. The key-dependent S-boxes
// are expanded into tables at setup, so lookups are indexed by data: not
// constant time.

namespace bignum;

import std;

// q0 then q1, the fixed byte permutations.
